From fd48a68e46b1033c31cedfed1e8f51977675270f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FreeholdOS Build <build@freeholdos.local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 21:27:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: give apps without an entry a persona under
 Isolated defaults

An app without an entry follows the defaults, but the persona plan only
listed apps with an entry, so under Isolated defaults those apps kept
their real location (D5). With place data present the plan now covers
every installed package of the owner user; without place data the apps
keep their real location, so no permission is revoked from all apps at
once. Protected defaults leave the location of an unconfigured app real.
---
 .../CompartmentsPolicyService.java            | 29 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../server/compartments/MirrorPlan.java       | 25 ++++++++++++++--
 .../server/compartments/PolicyStore.java      |  7 +++--
 3 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/core/java/com/android/server/compartments/CompartmentsPolicyService.java b/services/core/java/com/android/server/compartments/CompartmentsPolicyService.java
index 392c811..176b7d2 100644
